ubh|n|End; conclusion; termination; extinction. ; A sum of money paid as the settlement of a claim, or by way of terminating a matter in dispute; especially, a payment of money imposed upon a party as a punishment for an offense; a mulct. ; A final agreement concerning lands or rents between persons, as the lord and his vassal. ; A sum of money or price paid for obtaining a benefit, favor, or privilege, as for admission to a copyhold, or for obtaining or renewing a lease. ; To impose a pecuniary penalty upon for an offense or breach of law; to set a fine on by judgment of a court; to punish by fine; to mulct; as, the trespassers were fined ten dollars.	a:2bvj,34,3;2h0c,5,19;9dw,5,1;mzd,1,1~2h0c,5,19;2bvj,34,3;mzd,1,1;9dw,5,1	v:2h0o,31,312;1qwp,11,11;2h01,4,168;1qwm,1,19~2h0o,31,312;2h01,4,168;1qwm,1,19;1qwp,11,11	V:yfj,78,6;2bfb,47,20;2bep,32,3;56m,15,5~2bfb,47,20;yfj,78,6;56m,15,5;2bep,32,3	n:12zy,2,2;2h01,2,146~2h01,2,146;12zy,2,2	N:1lke,57,1;2bfb,39,12;56m,36,21;29b1,33,15;1lk0,31,2;2beo,20,3;53w,14,6;18n,12,1;l7d,11,28~l7d,11,28;56m,36,21;29b1,33,15;2bfb,39,12;53w,14,6;2beo,20,3;1lk0,31,2;18n,12,1;1lke,57,1
